{"cwd": "/sandbox/runs/harbor-dispatch/runs/eval-INC-268-r1-instincts/harbor-dispatch", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"content": [{"content": "INC-268  Add the Neopanamax vessel class\nstatus: open   priority: P3   area: registry   reported: 2026-09-15 by network-planning\n\nTwo Neopanamax ships join the transpacific service and the planner does not know the\nclass. Please add Neopanamax to the vessel registry: length 366 m, beam 51 m, draft 15\nm, 14000 TEU.\n\nAcceptance:\n  vesselClass(\"Neopanamax\") returns lengthM 366, beamM 51, draftM 15 and teu 14000;\n  classesForPort includes it for Singapore and not for Gdynia.\n\nFiles:\n  registry/vessels.csv\n  src/ports/registry.ts", "is_error": false, "tool_use_id": "toolu_019vLUJawxmRB6B9Fi8xL4CG", "type": "tool_result"}], "role": "user"}, "sessionId": "86122090-feb4-458e-bfcc-cc522a7f86c7", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T03:44:10.237Z", "toolUseResult": {"stdout": "INC-268  Add the Neopanamax vessel class\nstatus: open   priority: P3   area: registry   reported: 2026-09-15 by network-planning\n\nTwo Neopanamax ships join the transpacific service and the planner does not know the\nclass. Please add Neopanamax to the vessel registry: length 366 m, beam 51 m, draft 15\nm, 14000 TEU.\n\nAcceptance:\n  vesselClass(\"Neopanamax\") returns lengthM 366, beamM 51, draftM 15 and teu 14000;\n  classesForPort includes it for Singapore and not for Gdynia.\n\nFiles:\n  registry/vessels.csv\n  src/ports/registry.ts"}, "type": "user"}
